WEBVTT

01:37.770 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

01:43.150 --> 01:43.690
[Divine Constable Tally]

01:43.720 --> 01:45.690
[Episode 4]

01:46.870 --> 01:48.509
47 years ago,

01:49.229 --> 01:51.590
the Great Shi Dynasty wiped out Liluo.

01:51.710 --> 01:53.570
Their crimes were unforgivable.

01:54.120 --> 01:56.039
Tianmoluo took root here

01:56.120 --> 01:58.840
by the will of the God Kelu.

01:59.310 --> 02:02.370
It will feed on the lifeblood
of children from Great Shi

02:02.480 --> 02:05.040
to bear the fruit of vengeance.

02:15.080 --> 02:16.120
Wen Nansheng.

02:16.430 --> 02:17.470
I get it now.

02:17.680 --> 02:19.680
The killer first murdered Master Sun,

02:19.680 --> 02:21.710
then killed Wen Nansheng.

02:21.710 --> 02:22.710
He took the lower half of

02:22.710 --> 02:23.960
Wen Nansheng's body

02:24.120 --> 02:25.910
and mixed it with the upper half

02:25.910 --> 02:27.190
of Master Sun's.

02:27.470 --> 02:29.120
Master Sun's lower body

02:29.680 --> 02:31.400
and Wen Nansheng's upper body

02:31.840 --> 02:32.680
fit together perfectly

02:32.680 --> 02:34.079
to make one whole corpse.

02:34.470 --> 02:36.150
Corpses,

02:36.360 --> 02:37.680
puppets—

02:38.360 --> 02:39.310
they're nothing but

02:39.310 --> 02:41.400
lifeless things.

02:41.960 --> 02:43.840
The only fate waiting for them

02:44.120 --> 02:45.590
is decay.

02:46.950 --> 02:48.829
I hate decay.

02:48.900 --> 02:50.950
I hate death.

02:52.000 --> 02:54.350
Look at God Kelu.

02:54.520 --> 02:55.870
Never rots,

02:56.030 --> 02:57.490
never dies.

02:57.590 --> 02:59.079
Isn't that wonderful?

03:00.840 --> 03:02.630
You drain blood to make cursed incense,
harm young girls,

03:02.630 --> 03:03.630
kidnap children…

03:03.840 --> 03:04.910
and you killed Wen Nansheng

03:04.910 --> 03:06.030
and Master Sun.

03:06.150 --> 03:07.680
Why? Why did you do all this?

03:10.120 --> 03:12.810
You're all going to die anyway.

03:13.080 --> 03:14.870
Might as well tell you.

03:16.470 --> 03:19.400
Kelu, the great god
of the ancient Liluo Sect,

03:19.910 --> 03:22.630
rules over all growth and life.

03:23.680 --> 03:25.890
When he takes the form of Tianmoluo,

03:26.310 --> 03:28.910
he can bear the fruit of immortality.

03:30.190 --> 03:33.860
Eat it, and you stay young forever,

03:33.890 --> 03:35.740
never aging, never dying.

03:36.960 --> 03:40.030
For the fruit to ripen fully,

03:40.870 --> 03:43.030
I need the pure yang energy

03:43.030 --> 03:44.920
of 36 children

03:45.079 --> 03:49.480
to nourish Tianmoluo's dark yin body.

03:52.910 --> 03:54.520
You kidnapped all those children

03:54.520 --> 03:56.320
just to feed this evil creature?

03:56.910 --> 03:57.910
I understand now.

03:57.960 --> 03:59.470
Young boys possess pure yang essence.

03:59.470 --> 04:01.520
Between the ages of 6 and 13,

04:01.680 --> 04:02.840
as their kidney energy awakens,

04:02.840 --> 04:04.080
they lose their baby teeth
and grow new ones.

04:04.080 --> 04:04.840
Their inner vital energy

04:04.840 --> 04:06.150
is at its peak.

04:06.630 --> 04:08.030
No wonder all the kidnapped kids

04:08.030 --> 04:09.560
were the ones losing their teeth.

04:09.560 --> 04:10.710
You keep chanting

04:10.710 --> 04:12.280
"God Kelu is above us all."

04:12.280 --> 04:13.470
But in my eyes,

04:14.080 --> 04:15.120
all this talk

04:15.560 --> 04:17.290
just means you're afraid to die

04:17.450 --> 04:19.480
and crave immortality.

04:22.070 --> 04:23.560
Am I wrong,

04:24.160 --> 04:25.390
Master Coroner Wen?

04:33.830 --> 04:34.720
Li Qingyang.

04:34.920 --> 04:36.159
That's not Wen Nansheng.

04:36.159 --> 04:37.570
He's just a human puppet.

04:37.830 --> 04:39.560
Lady Fragrance was the puppet.

04:39.720 --> 04:42.830
And Wen Nansheng never died at all.

04:44.070 --> 04:45.630
He knew your autopsy skills
were unmatched,

04:45.630 --> 04:47.750
Master Coroner Bai.

04:48.070 --> 04:48.950
So

04:50.040 --> 04:50.830
he cut off the legs of

04:50.830 --> 04:52.480
someone with rheumatism

04:52.680 --> 04:53.750
to throw us off.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.630
He wanted

04:55.830 --> 04:57.920
to fake Wen Nansheng's death.

04:58.920 --> 05:00.430
Look at how swollen the legs are—

05:00.430 --> 05:01.720
that's rheumatism,

05:01.720 --> 05:04.070
from years of working in
damp, dark places.

05:04.070 --> 05:06.330
And the jade pendant left on the clothes…

05:06.360 --> 05:08.090
it must belong to Wen Nansheng.

05:08.560 --> 05:09.360
Earlier,

05:10.070 --> 05:11.270
he was speaking to us

05:11.270 --> 05:12.530
using ventriloquism.

05:12.830 --> 05:13.560
Pretending to be

05:13.560 --> 05:15.000
a mindless human puppet—

05:15.240 --> 05:16.830
it was all just an illusion.

05:17.240 --> 05:18.160
Wen Nansheng.

05:18.720 --> 05:20.480
Why did you kill Master Sun?

05:24.720 --> 05:26.370
Dougu County isn't big,

05:26.510 --> 05:27.920
but searching house by house

05:27.920 --> 05:29.450
for kids losing their teeth

05:29.630 --> 05:31.270
would take too long.

05:31.720 --> 05:33.950
Chunfeng Hall treats people

05:33.950 --> 05:35.560
with toothaches all the time.

05:35.560 --> 05:36.600
So I figure

05:37.070 --> 05:38.510
you got the list

05:38.510 --> 05:40.640
of teething children from Master Sun.

05:40.750 --> 05:41.630
That's why

05:41.870 --> 05:43.390
you killed Master Sun—

05:43.870 --> 05:45.830
to silence him.

05:46.360 --> 05:48.070
But if Master Sun had kept quiet,

05:48.070 --> 05:49.830
nothing would have been exposed.

05:49.830 --> 05:50.920
Why risk everything

05:50.920 --> 05:52.120
by killing Master Sun

05:52.240 --> 05:53.630
and drawing our investigation?

05:53.630 --> 05:55.950
Children in the county have been
going missing one after another.

05:55.950 --> 05:57.480
Right at this time,

05:57.830 --> 05:59.159
Master Sun's daughter,

05:59.159 --> 06:00.240
Yuyao, who just lost her baby teeth,

06:00.240 --> 06:01.390
also disappeared.

06:01.830 --> 06:03.390
Master Sun didn't know

06:03.510 --> 06:04.600
that Yuyao was actually

06:04.600 --> 06:05.950
kidnapped by bandits.

06:05.950 --> 06:09.160
He thought Wen Nansheng was too greedy

06:09.560 --> 06:11.630
and killed his daughter.

06:11.870 --> 06:13.400
You were partners in crime.

06:13.480 --> 06:15.140
Then you turned on each other.

06:15.270 --> 06:16.160
Wen Nansheng…

06:16.310 --> 06:18.680
you killed Lady Fragrance too, didn't you?

06:18.680 --> 06:19.480
To steal

06:19.480 --> 06:21.340
the Dead Bone Spice from her shop.

06:37.120 --> 06:39.630
That woman locked the door

06:40.090 --> 06:42.159
thinking I couldn't get in.

06:42.240 --> 06:44.040
But I got in anyway…

06:45.840 --> 06:48.040
and killed her with one stab.

06:53.070 --> 06:53.870
And then

06:55.700 --> 06:59.200
her cowardly brother

06:59.240 --> 07:00.830
just went mad.

07:06.720 --> 07:08.070
How did you get inside?

07:08.070 --> 07:09.070
Seize him first.

07:09.360 --> 07:10.870
Take him back. Interrogate slowly.

07:10.870 --> 07:11.680
Stop!

07:17.070 --> 07:18.190
Come any closer,

07:18.270 --> 07:19.920
and I'll kill Yuyao.

07:24.320 --> 07:27.310
The Divine Constable Bureau,

07:27.720 --> 07:30.160
solving cases by using
a little girl as bait?

07:30.160 --> 07:33.120
What kind of heroes are you?

07:34.120 --> 07:35.040
Wen Nansheng,

07:37.070 --> 07:38.830
Tell me—who

07:38.920 --> 07:40.630
put you up to all this?

07:40.630 --> 07:42.600
And who taught you

07:43.070 --> 07:45.010
the puppetry to control puppet doll?

07:45.010 --> 07:46.150
Want to know?

07:47.710 --> 07:49.890
Ask me in your next life.

08:05.890 --> 08:06.770
What's heck?

08:09.510 --> 08:10.480
What's heck?

08:10.480 --> 08:12.040
My little Hua Erbao.

08:12.120 --> 08:13.570
You've done well.

08:15.950 --> 08:16.750
What,

08:17.120 --> 08:18.830
only you get to use tricks and illusions?

08:18.830 --> 08:20.240
I can't play along too?

08:22.950 --> 08:24.830
So you never actually used Yuyao as bait.

08:24.830 --> 08:26.040
Lord Constable Ghost,

08:26.040 --> 08:28.680
Yuyao is safe and sound

08:28.680 --> 08:30.340
at Mrs. Hua's house right now.

08:30.850 --> 08:33.400
You have gone too far!

09:22.670 --> 09:23.670
My lords.

09:24.480 --> 09:25.270
These puppet dolls,

09:25.270 --> 09:26.840
although their moves are marvelous,

09:26.840 --> 09:28.440
are just mechanisms after all.

09:28.440 --> 09:29.500
Perhaps,

09:30.120 --> 09:31.720
if we hold on for a few more moves,

09:31.720 --> 09:33.510
their moves will repeat.

09:34.480 --> 09:35.270
A few moves?

09:36.840 --> 09:38.480
You'll find out once you fight.

09:38.480 --> 09:39.150
You!

10:23.490 --> 10:24.510
Trying to run?

10:51.440 --> 10:52.330
Now you know

10:52.360 --> 10:54.130
why I killed the coroner.

10:56.660 --> 10:59.050
-I want his face.
-How was the scent theft

10:59.240 --> 11:01.100
in the sealed chamber pulled off?

11:01.150 --> 11:03.910
The truth’s out now, isn’t it?

11:04.030 --> 11:05.270
Others couldn't get in.

11:05.270 --> 11:06.320
He is a dwarf,

11:06.440 --> 11:08.570
so he could crawl through the dog hole.

11:14.870 --> 11:16.230
The Divine Constable Bureau searched
all over Tianhuang City

11:16.230 --> 11:17.630
for a three-foot puppet.

11:17.630 --> 11:18.600
But in fact,

11:18.750 --> 11:19.770
there is no such thing as

11:19.770 --> 11:20.970
a three-foot puppet.

11:21.090 --> 11:22.310
From beginning to end,

11:22.310 --> 11:24.200
there was only you, a dwarf.

11:24.200 --> 11:25.840
This is called shrinking
a dragon into inches,

11:25.840 --> 11:27.330
an innate immortal body.

11:27.360 --> 11:28.660
So that's how it is.

11:29.270 --> 11:30.200
No wonder he harmed

11:30.200 --> 11:31.930
so many girls in Tianhuang City

11:32.000 --> 11:33.000
but was never brought to justice.

11:33.000 --> 11:35.440
As long as the dwarf's main body
wasn't found,

11:35.440 --> 11:37.080
he just needed to use other corpses

11:37.080 --> 11:38.360
to make puppet doll

11:38.440 --> 11:39.550
as a smokescreen.

11:41.530 --> 11:42.960
Great God of Kelu,

11:42.990 --> 11:44.720
please show your miracle.

11:44.720 --> 11:45.440
Get rid of

11:45.440 --> 11:46.870
these three heretics who dared disturb

11:46.870 --> 11:48.080
your slumber.

11:48.120 --> 11:49.630
So-called God Kelu…

11:50.240 --> 11:51.000
You've told so many lies

11:51.000 --> 11:52.800
you even believe them yourself.

12:02.260 --> 12:04.370
God Kelu has manifested!

12:25.750 --> 12:27.750
Meng Rui, Heaven-Measuring Ruler.

12:36.750 --> 12:39.550
Arrogant Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation!

13:19.120 --> 13:20.210
Mr. Meng.

14:07.630 --> 14:08.440
Li Qingyang.

14:08.440 --> 14:09.200
Li Si.

14:10.550 --> 14:11.390
I'm fine.

14:20.000 --> 14:20.960
Wen Nansheng!

14:21.190 --> 14:23.330
-Surrender now!
-My flowers!

14:27.200 --> 14:27.960
Great…

14:27.960 --> 14:30.520
God Kelu, Tianmoluo…

14:30.750 --> 14:31.910
destroyed by

14:31.910 --> 14:33.090
your hands…

14:33.200 --> 14:35.400
Do you not fear divine retribution?

14:37.120 --> 14:39.340
My Tianmoluo…

14:41.360 --> 14:43.900
God Kelu…

14:44.000 --> 14:46.790
help me.

15:01.870 --> 15:04.240
Those who do evil will destroy themselves.

15:04.240 --> 15:05.030
Ms. Bai.

15:05.670 --> 15:06.480
Mr. Meng

15:06.960 --> 15:08.420
hurry and save the people.

15:16.130 --> 15:18.680
[Dougu County Office]

15:16.750 --> 15:18.360
The children are all dead!

15:18.910 --> 15:19.870
My lord, my lord!

15:19.160 --> 15:25.400
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

15:19.870 --> 15:21.910
Our child can't die for nothing!

15:21.910 --> 15:22.630
My lord!

15:22.670 --> 15:23.790
My lord!

15:24.550 --> 15:25.360
My lord!

15:25.720 --> 15:28.030
I'm Cuicui's father!

15:28.120 --> 15:29.240
This is… Cuicui!

15:29.040 --> 15:30.780
[Enter the County Office
to Examine Oneself]

15:29.320 --> 15:30.150
My daughter is Cuicui!

15:30.150 --> 15:31.240
My lord, my lord!

15:31.240 --> 15:33.150
I'm Youyou's mother! My lord!

15:34.720 --> 15:36.270
Give us justice!

15:35.010 --> 15:36.700
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

15:41.480 --> 15:42.550
I, Li, am humble.

15:42.570 --> 15:44.450
Today I ask Mr. Du

15:44.480 --> 15:45.610
to bear witness.

15:46.270 --> 15:48.960
Here is five thousand taels of silver.

15:49.080 --> 15:50.910
One hundred taels as compensation
for each family.

15:49.140 --> 15:49.570
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

15:50.910 --> 15:51.910
That's too much…

15:52.550 --> 15:54.120
There were only about thirty children.

15:54.120 --> 15:55.030
The rest

15:55.150 --> 15:57.680
I shall donate entirely
to the county office.

15:58.790 --> 15:59.600
Good.

16:00.150 --> 16:00.790
Is that acceptable?

16:00.790 --> 16:01.150
Yes.

16:01.150 --> 16:02.120
Then why don't you say it?

16:02.120 --> 16:03.120
Good, good, good.

16:04.510 --> 16:06.310
Let them come collect the money.

16:07.320 --> 16:08.510
Everyone may approach.

16:08.510 --> 16:09.960
Stop! Do not enter!

16:10.120 --> 16:11.480
Don't rush! Don't fight!

16:11.480 --> 16:12.960
Who dares disrupt the court?

16:12.960 --> 16:14.490
You—give it to me first!

16:14.600 --> 16:15.200
Let go!

16:15.200 --> 16:16.200
Don't fight!

16:17.910 --> 16:18.720
Give it to me! Give it to me!

16:18.720 --> 16:19.670
Everyone gets their share.

16:19.670 --> 16:20.480
Out of my way!

16:22.000 --> 16:22.750
I was first!

16:22.750 --> 16:23.600
Don't fight!

16:23.720 --> 16:25.000
Protect me!

16:25.000 --> 16:25.870
My lord!

16:25.910 --> 16:26.960
My lord! My lord!

16:26.960 --> 16:27.670
No fighting!

16:27.670 --> 16:29.130
No fighting! No fighting!

16:30.120 --> 16:31.910
No fighting!

16:32.360 --> 16:33.440
Hold it tight!

16:33.870 --> 16:35.790
Hurry and register them!

16:36.390 --> 16:37.910
No one's registered yet!

16:37.940 --> 16:38.720
Stop standing around! Move!

16:38.720 --> 16:39.510
You unruly people!

16:39.510 --> 16:40.360
Don't leave!

16:40.440 --> 16:41.410
Don't leave!

16:41.510 --> 16:43.430
Give back my silver!

16:43.750 --> 16:45.270
You like eating chicken, don't you?

16:45.270 --> 16:46.550
Eat all you want this time.

16:46.550 --> 16:47.600
Write it all down!

16:47.600 --> 16:48.390
Write it down!

16:48.390 --> 16:49.650
Every last one of them!

16:58.870 --> 17:01.000
Really? A hundred taels for real?

17:02.600 --> 17:04.069
So much money!

17:06.720 --> 17:08.200
Father! Mother!

17:08.880 --> 17:09.750
I'm home!

17:11.790 --> 17:13.349
Mother!

17:13.349 --> 17:14.680
Father!

17:14.680 --> 17:15.790
Mother!

17:15.790 --> 17:16.589
Youyou!

17:16.640 --> 17:17.670
Mother!

17:17.720 --> 17:21.349
Father, my feet hurt.

17:21.400 --> 17:23.550
Father, Mother!

17:23.210 --> 17:25.180
[Noble Righteousness]
[Law Enforced Unwaveringly]

17:24.000 --> 17:26.240
Mother, I'm hungry.

17:28.109 --> 17:30.070
-Father! Father!
-Mother.

17:30.160 --> 17:32.110
I'm scared.

17:32.270 --> 17:33.180
-Father.
-Mother.

17:33.180 --> 17:34.640
Father!

17:34.790 --> 17:37.070
Father! Father!

17:38.270 --> 17:39.110
Sir,

17:39.590 --> 17:41.000
didn't the children all die?

17:41.000 --> 17:42.970
Mother, I'm so scared.

17:43.270 --> 17:45.000
Alright, let's go. Let's go. Let's go.

17:45.000 --> 17:45.920
Hurry home.

17:46.440 --> 17:47.240
Strange…

17:47.400 --> 17:48.110
These parents

17:48.110 --> 17:49.920
were weeping bitterly just now.

17:49.960 --> 17:51.920
Why have they suddenly changed faces?

17:51.920 --> 17:52.680
It's almost as if

17:52.680 --> 17:54.210
they were putting on an act.

17:55.070 --> 17:56.680
Could it be the children
weren't really taken?

17:56.680 --> 17:57.680
Or…

17:57.790 --> 17:58.960
the ones taken

17:58.960 --> 18:00.820
weren't even their own children?

18:03.030 --> 18:03.830
Yuyao,

18:04.480 --> 18:05.960
can you point out to me

18:06.350 --> 18:07.480
which one among them

18:07.750 --> 18:09.200
is Cuicui's father?

18:11.720 --> 18:13.650
Sesame cakes! Fresh sesame cakes!

18:14.110 --> 18:15.120
Sesame cakes!

18:15.270 --> 18:16.610
Sesame cakes!

18:16.720 --> 18:19.030
Two copper each!

18:21.270 --> 18:22.110
Let's go.

18:24.000 --> 18:25.480
Young master, come buy a cake!

18:25.480 --> 18:26.480
Two copper each!

18:32.470 --> 18:33.270
Mister,

18:33.790 --> 18:34.510
answer just one question,

18:34.510 --> 18:36.110
and this silver ingot is yours.

18:36.110 --> 18:38.880
Ask away.

18:39.030 --> 18:39.830
Is Niu Cuicui

18:40.110 --> 18:43.240
your own flesh and blood?

18:46.590 --> 18:48.110
-Father.
-Mother!

18:48.510 --> 18:49.510
-Mother!
-Mother!

18:49.510 --> 18:50.790
Father! Father!

18:50.790 --> 18:52.650
Mother! Mother!

18:52.680 --> 18:53.880
I missed you so much, Mother!

18:53.880 --> 18:55.350
Mother!

18:55.720 --> 18:56.550
Yuanbao!

18:59.320 --> 19:00.520
[Noble Righteousness]
[Law Enforced Unwaveringly]

19:00.110 --> 19:01.110
Yuanbao.

19:01.110 --> 19:02.240
-Yuanbao!
-Mother!

19:02.550 --> 19:03.420
Mother!

19:03.720 --> 19:05.240
-Yuanbao.
-I miss you.

19:05.240 --> 19:05.960
my child!

19:05.960 --> 19:07.640
I missed you!

19:07.880 --> 19:09.110
I missed you too.

19:09.110 --> 19:10.200
Are you alright?

19:20.880 --> 19:21.940
Fellow villagers,

19:22.110 --> 19:23.310
the reunion of family

19:23.720 --> 19:25.720
is the greatest joy under heaven.

19:26.400 --> 19:27.480
In that case,

19:28.680 --> 19:29.550
Mr. Du,

19:30.510 --> 19:32.590
I ask you to take back

19:32.750 --> 19:34.480
all this compensation silver.

19:36.500 --> 19:38.010
Get away from me!

19:38.110 --> 19:39.370
She's not my daughter!

19:40.400 --> 19:41.330
Father!

19:41.480 --> 19:42.440
Get out!

19:42.510 --> 19:43.310
Don't call me that!

19:43.310 --> 19:44.200
Mother!

19:44.270 --> 19:46.000
Mother, I'm sorry.

19:46.110 --> 19:46.920
What are you doing?

19:46.920 --> 19:48.000
Are you insane?

19:48.000 --> 19:49.310
It's a hundred taels of silver.

19:49.310 --> 19:50.270
Let's go! Let's go home!

19:50.270 --> 19:50.960
Let go!

19:52.070 --> 19:53.130
Who's your mother?

19:53.160 --> 19:54.160
Mother!

19:54.160 --> 19:54.750
I don't know you!

19:54.750 --> 19:55.720
Let go, do you hear me?

19:55.720 --> 19:56.880
Let's go! Back home!

19:57.960 --> 19:59.270
Father!

20:00.030 --> 20:00.830
Father!

20:02.440 --> 20:03.240
Father!

20:03.480 --> 20:04.270
Hurry!

20:04.550 --> 20:05.350
Get back!

20:06.110 --> 20:07.710
Shame on you, being a father!

20:08.070 --> 20:09.160
Have you no conscience?

20:09.160 --> 20:10.880
Your heart's been eaten by dogs!

20:10.880 --> 20:11.350
What are you doing?

20:11.350 --> 20:12.750
Even if Youyou isn't your own daughter,

20:12.750 --> 20:13.510
would you really abandon

20:13.510 --> 20:14.270
all affection

20:14.270 --> 20:15.720
just for a hundred taels?

20:15.720 --> 20:16.510
Shrew!

20:16.880 --> 20:18.310
Spouting nonsense and shouting in court!

20:18.310 --> 20:19.750
Guards! Silence her!

20:19.750 --> 20:20.160
Yes!

20:20.160 --> 20:21.670
Mother! Mother!

20:23.310 --> 20:24.790
Mother!

20:29.830 --> 20:30.640
Mrs. Hua,

20:31.750 --> 20:32.830
you said earlier

20:33.590 --> 20:35.250
Youyou isn't her birth child.

20:36.310 --> 20:37.110
Why not

20:37.790 --> 20:39.450
tell us everything in detail.

20:44.920 --> 20:46.550
It's all this corrupt official Du Yi'an!

20:46.550 --> 20:48.000
You abducted all these children

20:48.000 --> 20:48.790
and left them with us to raise.

20:48.790 --> 20:49.510
Dare you deny it?

20:49.510 --> 20:50.350
Shut up!

20:50.720 --> 20:51.580
Get out of here.

20:51.880 --> 20:52.680
Shut up.

20:52.680 --> 20:53.680
All those thirty-odd children

20:53.680 --> 20:54.720
who went missing in this county—

20:54.720 --> 20:56.070
including our Yuanbao,

20:56.200 --> 20:56.880
and the kids

20:56.880 --> 20:58.480
from other families in town—

21:00.110 --> 21:01.550
none of them are our own.

21:06.110 --> 21:07.070
Seven years ago,

21:07.200 --> 21:08.880
the neighboring county
was hit by a locust plague.

21:08.880 --> 21:10.310
Many people had nothing to eat.

21:10.310 --> 21:11.000
So they fled

21:11.000 --> 21:12.730
to Dougu County to beg for food.

21:13.350 --> 21:15.310
Adults could go hungry for a few days,

21:15.310 --> 21:16.480
but these little ones

21:16.480 --> 21:17.610
suffered terribly.

21:19.550 --> 21:20.480
Some were

21:20.480 --> 21:21.880
even newborns.

21:22.590 --> 21:25.070
How could their mothers feed
them with no milk?

21:25.070 --> 21:26.440
We could only watch

21:28.680 --> 21:30.000
helplessly

21:30.000 --> 21:31.960
as the children starved to death.

21:35.590 --> 21:36.830
Then this crooked official,

21:36.830 --> 21:37.680
Du Yi'an,

21:38.030 --> 21:39.480
came along.

21:39.480 --> 21:40.750
He bought children

21:40.750 --> 21:42.000
with a few soybean cakes,

21:42.000 --> 21:43.160
then handed those kids over
to young couples like us

21:43.160 --> 21:44.440
to raise.

21:44.960 --> 21:47.030
That's right, it's true!

21:47.070 --> 21:48.480
I was trying to save them from starving!

21:48.480 --> 21:49.880
I was saving people from misery!

21:49.880 --> 21:51.270
I was doing good deeds!

21:51.270 --> 21:52.030
Bah!

21:52.530 --> 21:53.440
You just wante

21:53.440 --> 21:54.400
to raise these kids

21:54.400 --> 21:56.030
to use them for yourself!

21:56.440 --> 21:57.400
Divine Constable,

21:57.400 --> 21:58.400
ever since

21:58.440 --> 21:59.970
the children went missing,

22:00.030 --> 22:02.200
this corrupt official not only
refused to investigate

22:02.200 --> 22:03.750
but also paid people to keep
their mouths shut.

22:03.750 --> 22:04.590
He said

22:04.640 --> 22:06.350
if anyone breathed a word,

22:06.350 --> 22:07.480
he'd kill them.

22:10.200 --> 22:11.590
Ask them!

22:13.000 --> 22:14.070
Go on, tell them!
L-Lord Constable,
you see?
This shrew is spreading lies!
Talking nonsense!

22:14.070 --> 22:15.240
Tell them!

22:15.240 --> 22:16.000
You guys...

22:17.790 --> 22:18.880
L-Lord Constable,

22:19.240 --> 22:20.070
you see?

22:20.440 --> 22:21.550
This shrew is spreading lies!

22:21.550 --> 22:23.350
-She’s talking nonsense.
-I...

22:24.590 --> 22:25.440
Mr. Meng,

22:25.440 --> 22:26.070
you are

22:26.070 --> 22:28.130
a high official from Tianhuang City.

22:28.370 --> 22:29.880
This corrupt dog Du Yi'an

22:29.880 --> 22:32.590
abducted innocent children.
He's utterly inhumane!

22:32.590 --> 22:34.200
You must uphold justice

22:34.200 --> 22:35.680
for these poor children

22:35.680 --> 22:37.030
of Dougu County!

22:37.030 --> 22:37.960
My lord! My lord!

22:41.550 --> 22:42.440
Mr. Du,

22:43.680 --> 22:45.070
you may not have known

22:45.160 --> 22:47.290
about Wen Nansheng and the Tianmoluo.

22:47.590 --> 22:48.880
But Wen Nansheng

22:49.030 --> 22:51.000
worked in the county office.

22:51.830 --> 22:53.680
If he wanted to take the children,

22:53.680 --> 22:54.880
he could fool others,

22:55.240 --> 22:57.170
but he could never hide it from you.

22:59.830 --> 23:00.680
I suspect

23:01.830 --> 23:03.550
you made a deal:

23:04.830 --> 23:07.070
once the children reached
the age of losing their teeth,

23:07.070 --> 23:09.830
Wen Nansheng would bribe you with silver.

23:10.350 --> 23:11.160
And you

23:11.790 --> 23:14.030
would look the other way.

23:18.000 --> 23:19.200
You thought

23:19.790 --> 23:22.200
these children weren't their real kids,

23:22.960 --> 23:23.750
so you

23:23.880 --> 23:26.640
could settle everything with money later.

23:27.680 --> 23:29.480
But you never expected

23:29.680 --> 23:30.480
this case

23:31.590 --> 23:33.850
would draw the Divine Constable Bureau.

23:39.020 --> 23:39.870
Mr. Meng,

23:40.680 --> 23:41.640
if you search

23:41.680 --> 23:43.000
Mr. Du's mansion

23:43.000 --> 23:44.190
right now,

23:44.240 --> 23:46.370
you will find a huge fortune in bribes.

23:56.200 --> 23:57.000
My lord,

23:57.160 --> 23:59.030
Dougu County is far from the capital.

23:59.030 --> 24:00.350
The whole county

24:00.350 --> 24:01.680
answers only to you.

24:01.680 --> 24:02.440
Why fear some constable?

24:02.440 --> 24:03.550
Am I right, folks?

24:03.590 --> 24:04.640
Don't you think so, everyone?

24:04.640 --> 24:05.160
Yeah!

24:05.160 --> 24:06.880
-Yeah!
-Exactly!

24:06.880 --> 24:07.680
Why should we be afraid of him?

24:07.680 --> 24:08.550
-Right!
-Exactly!

24:08.550 --> 24:10.270
To cut off a man's wealth
is like killing his parents.

24:10.270 --> 24:11.270
Who cares about some Divine Constable?

24:11.270 --> 24:12.830
We have the silver in our hands.

24:12.830 --> 24:13.830
We're not afraid of him.

24:13.830 --> 24:14.750
Yeah, not afraid!

24:14.750 --> 24:16.080
Not afraid! Not afraid!

24:22.270 --> 24:23.070
That's right.

24:24.550 --> 24:27.030
I am the upright magistrate of Dougu!

24:28.590 --> 24:29.830
I won't be pushed around

24:29.830 --> 24:31.680
by the two of you!

24:35.720 --> 24:36.510
Guards!

24:36.830 --> 24:37.280
Yes!

24:37.310 --> 24:38.070
-Yes!
-Yes!

24:43.680 --> 24:44.790
So that's

24:45.550 --> 24:47.200
where the bandits went.

24:48.680 --> 24:51.080
You've been colluding with them all along.

24:52.640 --> 24:53.480
Du Yi'an

24:54.790 --> 24:57.990
how dare you call yourself
the upright official of Dougu?

25:07.950 --> 25:13.410
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

25:10.200 --> 25:11.400
For money,

25:12.480 --> 25:13.680
you sell children.

25:14.350 --> 25:15.750
You tear apart families.

25:16.400 --> 25:20.340
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

25:16.590 --> 25:17.680
As parents,

25:18.200 --> 25:18.920
have you

25:18.920 --> 25:20.650
ever felt even a shred of guilt?

25:22.480 --> 25:24.480
You talk about silver in your hands.

25:26.260 --> 25:30.900
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

25:27.270 --> 25:29.200
Open your eyes and look!

25:29.350 --> 25:31.030
What are you really holding?

25:36.940 --> 25:37.330
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

25:37.890 --> 25:38.410
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

25:38.790 --> 25:39.590
This...

25:38.970 --> 25:39.970
[Clear as a Mirror]

25:40.160 --> 25:40.750
Where is the money?

25:40.750 --> 25:41.510
My money.

25:41.830 --> 25:43.550
What's going on?

25:43.550 --> 25:44.810
Why is it yellow paper?

25:45.350 --> 25:46.750
My money! It's gone!

25:46.880 --> 25:47.790
It's gone.

25:47.790 --> 25:48.680
Where is my money?

25:48.680 --> 25:49.640
The money is gone.

25:49.640 --> 25:50.640
Where is my money?

25:51.030 --> 25:52.200
My money is gone.

25:52.880 --> 25:54.550
My money.

25:55.270 --> 25:56.240
My money.

25:58.000 --> 26:00.400
What am I going to do?

26:00.400 --> 26:02.270
A hundred taels!

26:02.420 --> 26:06.680
[Clear as a Mirror]

26:02.980 --> 26:05.750
♪ Capture my heart ♪

26:05.270 --> 26:07.400
My money

26:06.460 --> 26:09.440
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

26:07.400 --> 26:08.880
Give me back my money

26:08.720 --> 26:12.200
[Clear as a Mirror]

26:10.330 --> 26:16.100
♪ Can we relive the mark you
once carved deep ♪

26:12.830 --> 26:13.760
Father Emperor…

26:14.350 --> 26:16.400
You still have the cricket
you made for me.

26:16.400 --> 26:18.350
But your son Yan'er is dead.

26:16.450 --> 26:19.670
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

26:16.640 --> 26:20.550
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

26:19.480 --> 26:21.680
You never cleared his name.

26:20.230 --> 26:23.460
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

26:22.270 --> 26:23.270
Do you ever

26:24.160 --> 26:26.160
feel even a little guilty?

26:24.530 --> 26:30.680
♪ Fall in love in a blink,
then fade to dust thin ♪

26:30.920 --> 26:33.920
♪ Dare not forget ♪

26:31.210 --> 26:35.280
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

26:34.930 --> 26:37.840
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

26:38.650 --> 26:44.850
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

26:43.400 --> 26:44.880
Greed devours the heart.

26:45.810 --> 26:47.550
Loyalty and love are worth less than mud.

26:47.320 --> 26:51.390
♪ Forever within your shadow
by your side ♪

26:52.000 --> 26:53.030
Kill them!

26:58.460 --> 26:59.650
Don't be afraid, brothers!

26:59.650 --> 27:01.350
Kill them and you'll be richly rewarded!

27:01.350 --> 27:02.200
Mr. Meng,

27:02.880 --> 27:04.640
group fighting is not my strength.

27:04.640 --> 27:05.550
Take care.

27:08.400 --> 27:09.200
Attack!

27:09.750 --> 27:10.690
[Be Honest and Uphold Public Duty]

27:12.030 --> 27:13.460
[Noble Righteousness][Law
Enforced Unwaveringly]

27:13.460 --> 27:14.890
[Enter the County Office
to Examine Oneself]

27:20.720 --> 27:21.400
Whoever moves

27:21.400 --> 27:22.550
dies next.

27:22.880 --> 27:24.340
This way! This way! Hurry!

27:24.790 --> 27:26.240
The Prefect is on his way here.

27:26.240 --> 27:28.300
I suggest you surrender peacefully.

27:29.390 --> 27:30.190
I surrender!

27:30.640 --> 27:31.440
I surrender!

27:33.890 --> 27:35.020
[Clear as a Mirror]

27:44.160 --> 27:44.960
Don't.

27:45.270 --> 27:46.750
I know you're angry,

27:47.030 --> 27:49.000
but Du Yi'an is a
court-appointed official.

27:49.000 --> 27:51.730
He must be taken back
to Tianhuang City for trial.

28:15.990 --> 28:17.020
[The God of Immortality, Kelu]

29:41.270 --> 29:42.030
Du Yi'an.

29:53.540 --> 29:54.480
It's you.

29:56.400 --> 29:57.200
Du Yi'an,

29:59.160 --> 29:59.920
you are

29:59.920 --> 30:01.520
magistrate of Dougu County,

30:01.790 --> 30:03.070
but your hometown

30:03.480 --> 30:04.790
is Dingzhou.

30:06.680 --> 30:08.160
After all these years,

30:08.680 --> 30:10.000
you're still

30:10.590 --> 30:12.400
the only jinshi from that area.

30:18.750 --> 30:19.830
You're a man well-read

30:19.830 --> 30:21.680
in the Confucian classics.

30:22.880 --> 30:25.590
Later you took office

30:26.440 --> 30:27.440
as county magistrate

30:27.440 --> 30:29.160
of Tong County in Suzhou.

30:29.440 --> 30:30.750
Only 8 years ago

30:31.440 --> 30:32.960
were you transferred here

30:32.960 --> 30:34.640
to serve as magistrate of Dougu.

30:34.640 --> 30:35.790
Am I right?

30:37.070 --> 30:38.400
How do you know all this?

30:40.350 --> 30:42.010
Has Your Lordship forgotten?

30:42.240 --> 30:43.440
I have money.

30:45.440 --> 30:47.160
Money makes the world go round.

30:47.160 --> 30:48.090
How hard can it be

30:48.960 --> 30:50.370
to investigate one man?

30:53.000 --> 30:53.790
Du Yi'an,

30:54.960 --> 30:56.090
back in Tong County,

30:56.680 --> 30:58.240
5 children also disappeared

30:58.240 --> 30:59.170
without reason.

30:59.480 --> 31:01.210
Their bodies were never found.

31:02.440 --> 31:04.240
Was that also your doing?

31:05.510 --> 31:06.310
I...

31:07.070 --> 31:07.680
I...

31:07.680 --> 31:08.590
Who ordered

31:08.590 --> 31:10.240
you to do this?

31:10.880 --> 31:12.160
Did you ever

31:12.590 --> 31:14.440
see someone controlling puppets?

31:14.440 --> 31:15.960
Did you ever see the true master

31:15.960 --> 31:17.030
behind the ?

31:17.480 --> 31:18.480
I don't know.

31:18.720 --> 31:19.510
Speak!

31:26.200 --> 31:27.660
Fine, fine, I'll tell you.

31:27.880 --> 31:29.680
It was always Wen Nansheng.

31:31.200 --> 31:32.070
Tong County,

31:32.070 --> 31:33.400
Dougu County—all of it.

31:33.550 --> 31:35.070
You already know.

31:47.750 --> 31:48.880
Who are you, really?

31:55.920 --> 31:56.720
Du Yi'an.

32:01.400 --> 32:03.070
I brought some friends here.

32:03.270 --> 32:04.070
They say

32:05.310 --> 32:06.510
they want to meet you.

32:07.270 --> 32:08.070
Who?

32:29.070 --> 32:30.270
Play with me.

32:30.440 --> 32:31.810
Play with me.

32:31.960 --> 32:34.240
-Play with me.
-Play with me.

32:34.260 --> 32:35.160
Play with me.

32:35.160 --> 32:35.770
No...

32:37.550 --> 32:38.680
don't come near!

32:39.680 --> 32:40.480
Go away!

32:41.440 --> 32:43.270
Go away! Go away!

32:45.680 --> 32:47.140
Don't… don't come closer!

32:51.330 --> 32:53.260
Don't come any closer!

32:54.880 --> 32:57.030
Don't come any closer!

32:59.750 --> 33:01.010
Don't come any closer!

33:01.480 --> 33:03.030
Go away! Go away!

33:03.050 --> 33:04.050
I'm begging you!

33:04.130 --> 33:05.850
Don't come near!

33:06.350 --> 33:07.680
Go away! Go!

33:08.680 --> 33:11.000
Hurry!

33:10.810 --> 33:13.290
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

33:11.070 --> 33:11.880
Hurry up!

33:12.510 --> 33:13.070
Faster!

33:14.480 --> 33:15.070
Faster!

33:15.070 --> 33:16.360
Officer, don't rush us!

33:16.360 --> 33:17.240
Please don't rush us!

33:17.240 --> 33:17.880
Quick!

33:18.510 --> 33:19.310
Hurry!

33:20.450 --> 33:23.340
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

33:21.070 --> 33:22.070
Bring up the rear!

33:27.240 --> 33:28.500
Good morning, Ms. Bai.

33:30.480 --> 33:31.480
Where is Mr. Meng?

33:32.550 --> 33:33.680
He's watching me,

33:33.680 --> 33:35.080
not the other way around.

33:35.480 --> 33:36.830
Report!

33:38.510 --> 33:39.270
Divine Constable!

33:39.270 --> 33:40.240
The prisoner Du Yi'an…

33:40.240 --> 33:41.240
he's dead in his cell.

33:41.240 --> 33:42.000
What?

33:42.070 --> 33:42.790
How did he die?

33:42.790 --> 33:45.070
It looks like he was scared to death.

33:47.240 --> 33:48.400
A man like him

33:48.680 --> 33:49.680
is better dead.

33:51.480 --> 33:52.270
Clean.

34:07.350 --> 34:08.679
Truly cleaner that way.

34:12.440 --> 34:13.400
We should leave.

34:14.000 --> 34:14.800
Let's go.

34:24.770 --> 34:27.460
[Star-Gathering Pavilion Branch]

35:08.190 --> 35:09.150
Everything checks out.

35:08.430 --> 35:09.660
[Great Shi's border troops win successive
battles, yet lack grain supplies.]

35:09.190 --> 35:10.030
News from the border.

35:09.690 --> 35:10.660
[A standoff with Northern Kun is set.
Both sides are trapped in a stalemate.]

35:10.030 --> 35:11.440
match those from Huangquanji.

35:10.690 --> 35:11.070
[Underworld Market]

35:11.440 --> 35:13.070
The Great Shi border troops
have won successive battles,

35:13.070 --> 35:14.280
but they lack grain and supplies.

35:14.280 --> 35:15.800
A stalemate with the Northern Kun
has formed.

35:15.800 --> 35:17.670
Neither side can back down.

35:20.960 --> 35:22.150
My lords,

35:22.760 --> 35:24.760
we've been traveling for half a day.

35:24.880 --> 35:26.230
Our throats are dry.

35:26.590 --> 35:29.150
Why don't we find a place to rest?

35:29.440 --> 35:30.840
The nearest post station

35:30.880 --> 35:32.840
is still 5 miles away.

35:33.280 --> 35:34.540
Lord Constable Ghost,

35:36.590 --> 35:38.030
who says only post stations

35:38.030 --> 35:39.430
exist on official roads?

35:57.070 --> 35:59.670
Alright, alright, alright.

36:00.590 --> 36:02.850
This is also a Star-Gathering Pavilion.

36:03.670 --> 36:04.480
Honestly,

36:04.800 --> 36:06.110
this is just

36:06.110 --> 36:07.230
a small branch.

36:10.670 --> 36:11.670
To be frank,

36:11.880 --> 36:14.280
I do have selfish motives.

36:15.280 --> 36:16.630
Dare I say,

36:17.150 --> 36:18.440
countless nobles and elites

36:18.440 --> 36:20.900
have entered the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

36:21.000 --> 36:23.070
If we can have the honor of

36:23.150 --> 36:24.230
Lord Constable Frost

36:24.230 --> 36:25.880
and Lord Constable Ghost's presence,

36:25.880 --> 36:28.400
our fame will flourish,

36:28.840 --> 36:30.500
and our halls will be blessed.

36:32.280 --> 36:33.480
A rest wouldn't hurt.

36:37.670 --> 36:38.930
Lord Constable Frost,

36:39.190 --> 36:40.230
you should know

36:40.440 --> 36:41.440
these

36:41.740 --> 36:43.250
cannot hold me.

36:43.440 --> 36:44.150
We've tried everything these days.

36:44.150 --> 36:45.590
Young Master Qingyang's

36:46.330 --> 36:48.610
power is beyond us.

36:48.640 --> 36:50.300
We truly cannot restrain him.

36:50.670 --> 36:52.280
Does Mr. Meng

36:52.280 --> 36:53.760
have another plan?

36:54.280 --> 36:55.070
How about…

36:55.670 --> 36:57.070
we cut his tendons?

36:57.070 --> 36:58.000
No need.

36:59.570 --> 37:01.740
Please, take a seat, both of you.

37:07.760 --> 37:09.230
Master, long time no see.

37:09.360 --> 37:10.150
I've prepared fine wine

37:10.150 --> 37:11.740
and food for the lords.

37:12.190 --> 37:13.070
Hurry up.

37:16.480 --> 37:17.630
My lords,

37:17.880 --> 37:18.670
would you say

37:19.230 --> 37:20.670
my Star-Gathering Pavilion

37:20.670 --> 37:21.880
is the finest restaurant

37:21.880 --> 37:24.070
in the Great Shi Dynasty?

37:31.550 --> 37:32.360
Alright…

37:33.000 --> 37:34.000
the dishes

37:34.190 --> 37:35.740
are a bit simple.

37:35.960 --> 37:38.400
I hope you'll forgive me.

37:46.480 --> 37:47.440
I don't drink.

37:58.030 --> 37:58.840
Let's eat.

38:01.280 --> 38:03.070
Mr. Meng, please.

38:11.440 --> 38:13.280
Ms. Bai, taste some.

38:14.800 --> 38:16.590
Don't worry—

38:16.760 --> 38:17.880
this won't be charged

38:17.880 --> 38:19.670
to the Divine Constable Bureau's
travel expenses.

38:19.670 --> 38:20.800
It's my treat.

38:20.880 --> 38:23.190
Please help yourselves.

38:24.000 --> 38:26.190
Master Li is certainly casual.

38:30.280 --> 38:31.960
Ms. Bai, please.

38:45.280 --> 38:46.190
Ms. Bai,

38:46.880 --> 38:48.070
you don't think

38:48.360 --> 38:49.670
I poisoned the food,

38:50.230 --> 38:51.630
do you?

38:59.440 --> 39:00.360
Ms. Bai,

39:00.670 --> 39:02.270
you're a master of medicine.

39:02.360 --> 39:03.760
Who would dare

39:03.760 --> 39:04.760
poison your meal?

39:06.400 --> 39:07.670
I dare not poison mine.

39:07.880 --> 39:09.230
But others might.

39:12.800 --> 39:14.130
That's not what I meant.

39:15.800 --> 39:17.230
Rest assured, my lords.

39:17.230 --> 39:17.840
Our master

39:17.840 --> 39:19.070
always teaches us

39:19.070 --> 39:20.760
the Star-Gathering Pavilion runs
a proper business.

39:20.760 --> 39:22.840
We obey the law and act with integrity.

39:22.840 --> 39:24.030
We never cheat

39:24.030 --> 39:25.400
or harm others.

39:26.230 --> 39:27.360
Even if our master

39:27.360 --> 39:29.150
is in cuffs before you,

39:30.120 --> 39:31.510
if he truly did

39:31.510 --> 39:32.670
something evil,

39:32.670 --> 39:33.230
we would never side with him.

39:33.230 --> 39:34.440
Well said!

39:34.440 --> 39:35.150
Good!

39:36.460 --> 39:37.520
Well said!

39:37.590 --> 39:38.800
Very well said!

39:39.750 --> 39:41.410
Splendidly said!

39:43.990 --> 39:45.230
Though it's a branch,

39:45.280 --> 39:47.410
it has the spirit of the main Pavilion.

39:47.880 --> 39:48.670
Let's eat.

39:53.840 --> 39:54.900
Where is everyone?

39:55.880 --> 39:57.280
Why are you just standing there?

39:57.280 --> 39:58.440
Serve them!

39:58.460 --> 39:59.540
Yes! Yes!

39:59.840 --> 40:00.970
Xiaohong, Xiaoyue,

40:01.670 --> 40:02.480
come here!

40:24.770 --> 40:25.730
My lords,

40:25.980 --> 40:28.490
now the atmosphere is right.

40:32.030 --> 40:32.800
Go! Go! Go!

40:32.800 --> 40:33.480
Hurry!

40:34.480 --> 40:35.280
Hurry up.

40:36.150 --> 40:36.960
Li Si!

40:37.480 --> 40:38.960
What are you really up to?

40:39.400 --> 40:40.800
Let me be clear:

40:40.800 --> 40:41.630
there is

40:41.840 --> 40:43.440
no way you're being set free.

40:47.670 --> 40:48.670
My lords,

40:49.070 --> 40:50.190
don't be angry.

40:51.590 --> 40:52.400
I truly

40:53.630 --> 40:55.000
have one question

40:55.400 --> 40:56.760
to ask the both of you.

41:02.170 --> 41:05.920
Does the Divine Constable
Bureau have any openings?

41:08.230 --> 41:10.290
Back to the Divine Constable Bureau.

41:11.420 --> 41:12.950
You want to join the Divine
Constable Bureau?

41:12.950 --> 41:13.830
In your dreams.

41:15.800 --> 41:16.820
Where's the owner?

41:16.820 --> 41:19.210
[Bright Breeze and Clear Moon]

41:17.230 --> 41:18.150
Sir.

41:18.190 --> 41:19.670
We're taking over this place tonight.

41:19.670 --> 41:21.770
No one else stays here.

41:21.880 --> 41:23.510
-We have guests in the upper room.
-Let’s have dinner first.

41:23.510 --> 41:24.230
Insolence!

41:25.230 --> 41:26.630
Do you know who this is?

41:26.840 --> 41:28.240
This is Young Master Wen.

41:44.260 --> 41:45.130
Leave!

41:49.510 --> 41:50.400
All of you, out!

41:51.550 --> 41:52.280
Out! Out! Out!

41:52.280 --> 41:52.590
Get out!

41:52.590 --> 41:53.110
Out! Out! Out!

41:53.110 --> 41:55.710
He looks like a Great Shi merchant,

41:56.030 --> 41:57.030
but his features

41:57.070 --> 41:58.480
are not those of a southern Han Chinese.

41:58.480 --> 41:59.730
We'll check with the Constabulary.

41:59.730 --> 42:01.080
Find out his identity.

42:15.280 --> 42:16.670
Reports from the border branch say

42:16.670 --> 42:17.960
the Crown Prince of Northern Kun

42:17.960 --> 42:19.710
has arrived incognito with an envoy party.

42:19.710 --> 42:20.670
Calculating the days,

42:20.670 --> 42:21.880
this must be them.

42:21.510 --> 42:24.440
[Northern Kun's Crown Prince and envoys
arrive in disguise, in secret.]

42:21.880 --> 42:23.800
Wen is the royal surname of Northern Kun.

42:23.800 --> 42:25.630
So this Young Master Wen is…

42:24.470 --> 42:25.120
[Border Branch]

42:26.460 --> 42:30.280
[Prince of Northern Kun, Wenbu]

42:30.440 --> 42:31.440
Young Master Wen.

42:31.920 --> 42:33.550
Throw out everyone already staying here.

42:33.550 --> 42:34.550
Out of the way!

42:35.630 --> 42:36.490
All of you, out!

42:36.880 --> 42:38.030
Out! Out! Now!

42:38.150 --> 42:38.960
Out!

42:39.000 --> 42:40.070
Go! Go! Hurry!

42:40.110 --> 42:41.370
Let's go.

42:42.800 --> 42:43.710
Young Master Wen.

42:43.710 --> 42:44.360
Out! Out! Out!

42:44.360 --> 42:45.880
Anyone staying at
the Star-Gathering Pavilion

42:45.880 --> 42:47.800
is a guest, regardless of status.

42:47.830 --> 42:48.580
Upstairs!

42:49.190 --> 42:49.980
Hurry up!

42:51.940 --> 42:55.570
If you don't leave, you'll be dead.

43:00.030 --> 43:00.930
The dead

43:01.480 --> 43:03.080
can hardly be called guests.

43:04.240 --> 43:05.470
Hurry! Don't dawdle!

43:05.500 --> 43:07.750
-I’ll count to three.
-Keep up. Hurry!

43:08.000 --> 43:09.070
1.

43:09.350 --> 43:11.010
Move over there!

43:11.670 --> 43:12.480
2.

43:17.190 --> 43:18.000
Who dares?

43:21.650 --> 43:28.390
[Divine Constable Tally]

43:22.230 --> 43:23.360
By the law of the Great Shi,

43:23.360 --> 43:25.280
anyone who wields weapons openly

43:25.280 --> 43:26.440
and runs rampant in broad daylight

43:26.440 --> 43:27.320
shall be flogged 50 times

43:27.320 --> 43:28.630
and imprisoned for three months.

43:28.630 --> 43:30.830
It's the Divine Constable Bureau seal.

43:39.510 --> 43:40.480
Well, well.

43:40.710 --> 43:42.070
You're a girl from this inn, aren't you?

43:41.810 --> 43:43.100
[Divine Constable Tally]

43:43.320 --> 43:45.670
Not bad looking.

43:52.070 --> 43:54.150
This is interesting.

43:57.320 --> 43:59.150
Your Star-Gathering Pavilion

43:59.250 --> 44:01.250
is quite creative.

44:01.670 --> 44:03.110
Come on, untie him.

44:03.280 --> 44:04.920
Chain yourself to me.

44:05.190 --> 44:06.760
Tonight, I am

44:06.760 --> 44:08.670
going to have some fun with you.
